    "updated_at": "2025-04-10T07:23:46Z",
    "body": "> but matching `Window` lifetime would be more normal\n\nI agree with the sentiment, but at least WebKit (and I strongly suspect Chromium unless all that code changed) strongly ties the `Document` and script execution context together. I think it's okay to ignore this until we figure out #3267 though.",
